Maintainer: Dominik Schulz <dominik.schulz@uni-paderborn.de>
Description: Implement a variety of models from a very broad family of exponential generalized autoregressive heteroskedasticity (EGARCH) models,
  such as a MEGARCH (modified EGARCH), FIEGARCH (fractionally integrated EGARCH), MAFILog-GARCH (modulus asymmetric fractionally
  integrated Log-GARCH), and more. For convenience and the purpose of comparison, also a fractionally integrated asymmetric
  power ARCH (FIAPARCH) can be implemented.
